        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Predecessor</i> is an atmospheric, surreal walking simulator. Traverse a series of abstract, ephemeral worlds. Interact with various strange characters and objects. Collect artifacts and memories scattered across the worlds. Follow the path of the one who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game engages in themes including the postmodern pastiche, artistic intent, and the presence of virtual spaces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract and surreal environments to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esoteric and silly characters who talk about things!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items which shed light on the world and its formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong emphasis on narrative and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fairly short experience (1-2 hours).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds that will not last.</p></li></ul>",
